WEBVTT

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.580
"Mysterious labyrinth"?

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:03.590
Yeah.

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:09.990
A famous mysterious item artist named 
Reinette passed away recently.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:14.210
"Hey, there. I hid a treasure 
inside a mysterious labyrinth.

00:00:14.690 --> 00:00:18.160
I'll give it to whoever finds my remains.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.480
On the night of the full moon, 
the correct door will open.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
<b>turn over the twisted truth</b>

00:00:22.050 --> 00:00:27.190
You're so cunning, witty, and smart, I'm 
sure you'll turn over the twisted truth.

00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:29.110
Sincerely, Reinette."

00:00:29.590 --> 00:00:32.000
In other words, it's a treasure hunt.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.330
Yeah. Pretty exciting, right?

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:38.260
I wonder what Reinette's treasure is.

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:45.580
Damn! I was so close!

00:00:46.180 --> 00:00:49.450
Looks like it won't be easy.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:50.830
Yeah.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:02.510
Is someone there?

00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.250
Grandma, Nico-nii!

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.510
Ramune and his assistant?

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:29.330
Did you think you could 
get away from me, idiot?

00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.670
It's good to see you again, Master Momiji.

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:08.330
<b>Dr. Ramune
Mysterious Disease Specialist</b>

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:14.960
<b>Episode 9 "Mysterious Labyrinth"</b>

00:03:11.740 --> 00:03:16.110
I see. So you received an invitation, too.

00:03:16.390 --> 00:03:17.830
Uh, y-yes.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.040
Anyway, I'm surprised you 
have an assistant now.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:23.300
Made quite a name for yourself, have you?

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.610
Hello.

00:03:26.010 --> 00:03:28.320
What's gotten into you?

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:32.060
He feels the trauma in his bones.

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:35.060
All those harsh training sessions...

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.150
Just remembering them sends 
chills down my spine.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:48.390
This is unusual, though.

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:52.150
Normally you're a lone wolf, but you're 
here with Grandma and Nico-nii.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.930
Where are you going, Momiji?

00:03:55.930 --> 00:03:57.630
The entrance is that way.

00:03:58.330 --> 00:03:59.890
Oh, right.

00:03:59.890 --> 00:04:03.620
You couldn't have made it here on your own 
given your terrible sense of direction.

00:04:04.290 --> 00:04:06.120
Did you say something?

00:04:07.260 --> 00:04:09.530
That idiot. He shouldn't have said that.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:14.710
Pipopo-chan can only guide him 
to places he's visited before.

00:04:14.710 --> 00:04:16.010
Pipopo-chan?

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:19.490
That thing. It's a mysterious guide pet.

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:23.740
We will be your guides.

00:04:23.740 --> 00:04:27.580
No cameras, smartphones, or mysterious 
items are permitted beyond this point.

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:34.450
Moke-chan, be good while we're gone.

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:41.430
Momiji, what are you doing?

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.410
Nothing.

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.560
We have finished examining your belongings.

00:04:47.070 --> 00:04:49.490
Your time will be up when 
your candles burn out.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:53.300
Now please head inside.

00:04:57.330 --> 00:05:00.140
Welcome to the mysterious labyrinth.

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.480
They're like works of art.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:08.570
All the mysterious items here, 
including the labyrinth itself,

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:11.240
were made by Reinette.

00:05:11.730 --> 00:05:13.340
All of this?

00:05:18.250 --> 00:05:20.000
<b>Ash</b>

00:05:30.960 --> 00:05:35.220
Please complete the missions 
and acquire all seven keys.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.480
Mirrors?

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.590
They cloned me and Grandma?

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:02.070
What's going on?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.090
<b>Find the real person</b>

00:06:05.260 --> 00:06:08.500
I see. This must be our mission.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:10.680
How are we supposed to find 
the real one, though?

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:11.910
It's me.

00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:13.880
It's me. It's me, Nico-nii.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:13.060
Allow me.

00:06:13.880 --> 00:06:15.350
You can tell, right?

00:06:16.970 --> 00:06:21.650
<i>Their voices are identical, but they can't 
copy the sound of their heartbeats.</i>

00:06:22.130 --> 00:06:25.440
Oh, right. Nico-san's exceptional 
hearing should do the trick.

00:06:34.580 --> 00:06:36.520
Grandma, I found you.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:39.130
Thank you.

00:06:39.570 --> 00:06:43.590
I knew you'd find me.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.950
Impressive as always, Nico-san.

00:06:45.950 --> 00:06:48.330
Master, it's me.

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.830
I'm the real one.

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:53.960
I can't believe the trouble 
you're causing me.

00:06:54.290 --> 00:06:56.820
You've got some guts, idiot!

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:02.590
Impressive.

00:07:02.590 --> 00:07:03.980
Naturally.

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:05.680
How did you figure it out?

00:07:06.100 --> 00:07:08.300
It's plain as day.

00:07:08.300 --> 00:07:10.990
The stupidest-seeming one of 
the lot is the real thing.

00:07:10.990 --> 00:07:12.110
<b>Find the real person</b>

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.480
It's different from before.

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:32.180
That's not all.

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:33.200
Look.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:37.640
Don't let this surprise you.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:40.320
<i>The</i> Reinette built this labyrinth.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.070
Momiji is right.

00:07:43.070 --> 00:07:44.930
Our time is limited, too.

00:07:45.250 --> 00:07:48.320
Then wouldn't it be more 
effective for us to split up?

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:02.090
Doctor? Ayame-san? Nico-san?

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:04.720
We've been led astray already.

00:08:05.220 --> 00:08:06.510
Well, no matter.

00:08:06.730 --> 00:08:09.830
That group has both Ayame-san and Nico.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:12.730
More importantly, we need the keys.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:13.610
Let's go.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:27.770
<b>Pierce the armor's heart using the sword</b>

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:27.760
"Pierce the armor's heart using the sword."

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:47.420
Does this suit of armor copy my movements?

00:08:48.130 --> 00:08:52.760
Which means piercing its heart would 
pierce mine at the same time.

00:08:53.270 --> 00:08:54.850
What am I supposed to do?

00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.620
Your movements aren't bad.

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:01.870
The way you carry yourself and 
your reflexes aren't bad, either.

00:09:01.870 --> 00:09:04.010
Have you trained in martial arts?

00:09:04.490 --> 00:09:06.400
My family runs a dojo.

00:09:06.600 --> 00:09:10.890
Ah, a dojo. I have a plan for you, then.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:14.390
That suit of armor is simply 
tracing your movements.

00:09:14.390 --> 00:09:16.900
It's not your body.

00:09:18.190 --> 00:09:19.400
<i>That's it.</i>

00:09:21.280 --> 00:09:24.790
<i>I'll do something as a living
 person that the armor can't copy.</i>

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.140
Now's my chance!

00:09:39.920 --> 00:09:44.190
Impressive. Both your mind 
and body are flexible.

00:09:44.520 --> 00:09:47.450
We still have your armor to deal with.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:51.240
There's a simpler and easier method.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.180
I'll move faster than it can keep up with...

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.330
and pierce its heart!

00:10:06.180 --> 00:10:07.540
That's the second one.

00:10:07.540 --> 00:10:10.210
<i>H-He's so cool...</i>

00:10:09.580 --> 00:10:11.790
<b>Respect</b>

00:10:25.820 --> 00:10:30.570
Jeez. We get separated the second 
we take our eyes off each other.

00:10:32.280 --> 00:10:34.020
This is Reinette.

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:39.560
"Reinette adored his own creations.

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:43.700
His greatest joy was the time he 
spent creating mysterious items.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:48.780
Though illness consumed his flesh, until the 
very moment his heart stopped beating,

00:10:48.780 --> 00:10:52.440
he was holding the glass pen 
he used to draw his plans."

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.970
Hey, someone's coming.

00:11:03.280 --> 00:11:04.380
Keys?

00:11:05.060 --> 00:11:09.440
<b>Find the box that contains the apple</b>

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:08.860
"Find the box that contains the apple."

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.880
Go open that box this instant.

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:19.610
What?

00:11:22.090 --> 00:11:24.290
That one way up at the top?

00:11:25.180 --> 00:11:26.480
Hurry up.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:27.830
Yes, sir!

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:38.580
Found it.

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:39.650
Huh?

00:11:40.280 --> 00:11:43.440
Every last one of these boxes are decoys.

00:11:43.440 --> 00:11:47.560
Misdirect people's attention elsewhere
 in order to hide the answer.

00:11:48.030 --> 00:11:50.060
It's basic deception.

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:52.540
Seriously?

00:11:56.930 --> 00:12:00.310
You should've said so sooner 
if you already knew that.

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:05.450
Fool. If I did that, I'd miss 
out on my own amusement.

00:12:07.900 --> 00:12:09.950
I heard you were in the hospital.

00:12:11.070 --> 00:12:13.230
Ayame-san told me.

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.330
She said you were badly injured and 
nearly died while protecting a patient.

00:12:17.260 --> 00:12:19.330
I've told you countless times

00:12:19.770 --> 00:12:22.300
to maintain an appropriate 
distance from your patients.

00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.350
Stop indiscriminately 
empathizing with everybody.

00:12:25.530 --> 00:12:29.560
If you can't do that, then you should close 
your mysterious disease clinic this instant.

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:33.980
Otherwise, you'll make the people 
around you unhappy, too.

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:43.320
<b>Listen to my song</b>

00:12:37.570 --> 00:12:44.050
I am the Manga King!

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.410
Nico, are you okay?

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:47.500
It's no use.

00:12:47.500 --> 00:12:50.260
My ears are ringing so 
much, I can't hear you.

00:12:50.260 --> 00:12:52.170
Let's take a break.

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:55.420
You're right. We've gathered 
most of the keys, too.

00:12:55.710 --> 00:13:00.560
Since Momiji-san has one, 
all together we have five.

00:13:00.560 --> 00:13:01.710
Don't move.

00:13:03.230 --> 00:13:07.040
Hand over your keys. If you don't...

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.820
Don't move!

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:19.510
Reinette's mysterious items 
are incredibly valuable.

00:13:20.080 --> 00:13:23.940
We'll do whatever it takes to 
acquire Reinette's treasure.

00:13:24.350 --> 00:13:27.440
We'll use you guys as bait 
to take your friends' keys.

00:13:28.130 --> 00:13:31.450
But you, brat. I ain't gonna let that one go!

00:13:33.550 --> 00:13:36.450
Wait. Someone's there.

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:41.740
Kuro!

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:42.710
Those guys—

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:44.380
Don't charge in there blindly.

00:13:44.380 --> 00:13:46.670
He's got a gun, real or not.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.030
Let go of me.

00:13:49.030 --> 00:13:50.720
What are you going to do if you get shot?

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:51.500
I don't care.

00:13:52.660 --> 00:13:54.520
This is exactly what I'm talking about.

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.480
Calm down.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:59.510
Who's standing right in front of you?

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:11.630
Master Momiji.

00:14:12.350 --> 00:14:13.550
Good.

00:14:14.190 --> 00:14:18.040
Do you think there's any 
problem that I can't solve?

00:14:18.520 --> 00:14:19.740
No.

00:14:22.850 --> 00:14:24.010
Open your mouth.

00:14:24.010 --> 00:14:24.850
Ah...

00:14:25.430 --> 00:14:26.860
We'll use this.

00:14:35.740 --> 00:14:37.960
Looks like your friends have arrived.

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:40.600
Hey, don't move.

00:14:40.600 --> 00:14:42.180
Wh-What's going on?

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:43.410
What?

00:14:43.730 --> 00:14:46.400
Is everyone a-all right?

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:51.160
If you want us to release your 
friends, hand over your keys.

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:52.840
V-Very well.

00:14:52.840 --> 00:14:53.250
Oops.

00:14:54.210 --> 00:14:57.040
Sheesh, this is taking forever.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.230
What are you—

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:06.690
How dare you strike my apprentice!

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:15.310
Doctor?

00:15:19.170 --> 00:15:21.790
Their guns were fake after all.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:26.180
Now, what should I do with you?

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.940
I wasn't expecting you 
to use a Cattail Flower.

00:15:35.610 --> 00:15:40.090
By using the Cattail Flower 
to turn Pipopo invisible,

00:15:40.090 --> 00:15:42.810
he was able to bring both inside 
without being detected.

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:47.210
He's truly a cunning man.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:52.090
In any case, now we have all seven keys.

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:17.620
<b>Find Reinette's remains</b>

00:16:18.150 --> 00:16:20.610
Looks like a study.

00:16:23.660 --> 00:16:24.590
Huh?

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:27.120
It won't open.

00:16:27.120 --> 00:16:29.170
What? Seriously?

00:16:29.170 --> 00:16:32.460
A single person is probably 
meant to gather all seven keys.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:36.100
Otherwise, groups with more 
members would have an advantage.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:37.360
I see.

00:16:37.360 --> 00:16:39.730
Let's let Ramu-chan handle this.

00:16:41.810 --> 00:16:45.100
Where are Reinette's remains?

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:50.720
We're running out of time.

00:16:50.720 --> 00:16:51.860
Doctor...

00:16:52.240 --> 00:16:54.120
He'll be able to find them.

00:16:54.360 --> 00:16:57.340
He may not be perfect, but 
he's still my apprentice.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:09.370
"Illness consumed his flesh, and until the 
very moment his heart stopped beating,

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:13.790
he was holding the glass pen 
he used to draw his plans."

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.780
The object Reinette held on to until the end.

00:17:19.130 --> 00:17:20.580
I bet his family...

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:30.180
<i>When he was cremated, if his 
ashes stuck to the glass...</i>

00:17:32.540 --> 00:17:34.630
Then these are Reinette's remains.

00:17:35.190 --> 00:17:39.470
<i>Congratulations. You've arrived 
at the correct answer.</i>

00:17:49.140 --> 00:17:50.110
Doctor.

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:54.240
You found Reinette's remains.

00:17:54.240 --> 00:17:55.910
So, where's the treasure?

00:17:56.310 --> 00:17:57.930
I got it.

00:17:59.360 --> 00:18:00.840
What's that book?

00:18:01.620 --> 00:18:02.580
Let me see.

00:18:05.090 --> 00:18:06.190
It's a catalog.

00:18:06.190 --> 00:18:10.690
It says we can have any one of 
Reinette's mysterious items.

00:18:10.690 --> 00:18:13.950
Seriously? That's so generous!

00:18:14.410 --> 00:18:15.170
Huh?

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:19.060
Here you are, Ayame-san. 
Thank you for today.

00:18:19.060 --> 00:18:21.160
What? Really? Are you sure?

00:18:21.160 --> 00:18:23.540
Master? This is my—

00:18:29.450 --> 00:18:31.470
Nico-nii!

00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:38.420
<i>Something still seems off.</i>

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:41.710
Kuropi, did you not get enough sleep?

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.750
I'll give you some energy. Charge!

00:18:45.400 --> 00:18:46.620
Thanks.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:51.780
<i>Since then, the doctor 
has been acting strange.</i>

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:57.320
Mysterious Disease Specialist

00:18:57.640 --> 00:19:01.450
<i>Did he want Reinette's treasure that badly?</i>

00:19:13.800 --> 00:19:16.090
Ah, it's you.

00:19:17.800 --> 00:19:19.570
Why are you here?

00:19:19.570 --> 00:19:21.080
The same reason you are.

00:19:22.080 --> 00:19:24.190
To find the truth.

00:19:28.550 --> 00:19:31.570
"You're so cunning, witty, and smart,

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:35.440
<b>turn over the twisted truth</b>

00:19:31.570 --> 00:19:34.840
I'm sure you'll turn over 
the twisted truth."

00:19:35.640 --> 00:19:39.680
Both terms mean to flip 
something over, or reverse it.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:44.700
So if the correct answer is the full moon, 
then the true answer is the new moon.

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:42.660
<b>Correct</b>

00:19:43.370 --> 00:19:44.700
<b>True</b>

00:19:44.980 --> 00:19:47.660
"Correct" and "true" are 
two separate concepts.

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:56.710
<b>Find Reinette's remains</b>

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:56.720
It doesn't specify that 
they're inside this room.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.720
By having us complete 
missions in various rooms,

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:08.110
we were given the impression that we should
 search inside that room for the remains.

00:20:08.110 --> 00:20:12.480
Are you saying that ultimately there 
was no need to gather the keys?

00:20:12.950 --> 00:20:14.600
No, it was necessary.

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:20.450
The more keys a person gathers, the more 
they believe that act must have meaning.

00:20:20.450 --> 00:20:22.830
It takes them further away from 
the undisguised truth.

00:20:23.610 --> 00:20:27.860
If the inconspicuous glass pen at the end 
of the labyrinth is the "correct" answer,

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:31.870
then the "true" answer is the first thing 
you see when you enter the labyrinth:

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:33.980
this eye-catching painting.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:36.500
<b>Ash</b>

00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:41.820
This painting?

00:20:43.270 --> 00:20:48.130
Now, then. I'm terribly sorry, but I can't 
let you see what happens next.

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.040
What?

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:55.270
Forgive me. I'll take you home later.

00:20:57.530 --> 00:20:58.830
Now, then...

00:21:06.100 --> 00:21:07.480
I knew it.

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:13.080
<i>Thank you. You have arrived at the truth.</i>

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:18.300
<i>As one who truly understands, 
I give you my treasure.</i>

00:21:20.570 --> 00:21:24.420
It's finally mine. The rare 
"Mysterious Old Book."

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:26.700
I've searched so hard for this.

00:21:28.780 --> 00:21:31.900
I can't believe the trouble you 
caused me, fool apprentice.

00:21:40.320 --> 00:21:44.250
This was a marvelous work 
you left us. Rest in peace.

00:23:25.310 --> 00:23:30.040
<i>Finally, the tear-jerking and moving 
circumstances of our meeting will be revealed!</i>

00:23:30.040 --> 00:23:30.880
<i>Tear-jerking?</i>

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:32.430
<i>It made all of America cry!</i>

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.130
<i>Doctor, I'm going to make </i>you<i> cry.</i>

